            "type_base": "Night Walk",
            "type_local": "夜间散步",
            "note_base": "Kunming's most beloved urban park — willow-lined lake, local vendors, and a perfect pre-bar evening stroll",
            "note_local": "昆明最有生活气息的公园，柳树湖边、本地人纳凉，傍晚散步最惬意",
            "notes_base": "After dinner, start the evening with a walk around Cuihu (Green Lake) Park. In June the park is lush and alive — locals play chess, couples stroll, and the lakeside paths are lit softly. The park is right next to the Wenlin Street cultural area (文林街), so you can seamlessly transition to cafe or bar hopping afterward. Free entry. Open until 22:00.",
            "notes_local": "晚饭后从翠湖公园开始昆明的夜晚，6月公园绿意正浓，湖边柳树垂下，本地人乘凉下棋，气氛生活感十足。公园紧连文林街文艺区，逛完可以直接步行去咖啡馆或酒吧。免费开放，约22:00关闭。",
            "optional": false,
