            "type_local": "书店咖啡馆",
            "note_base": "Four-story independent bookstore beside Cuihu — literature, art, travel books, coffee, and a self-study room; the INFJ dream spot in Kunming",
            "note_local": "翠湖边四层独立书店，文学艺术旅行类选书极佳，有咖啡和自习室，文艺人的昆明圣地",
            "notes_base": "Highly recommended on 小红书 for its thoughtful curation — literature, art, travel, and Yunnan culture. Four floors to explore slowly. Has coffee (around 35-45 CNY per drink) and a self-study room for quiet sitting. Located on Cuihu North Road, just steps from the park. Open until around 21:00-22:00. A perfect gentle evening activity after the park walk.",
            "notes_local": "小红书高度推荐的昆明独立书店，选书涵盖文学、艺术、旅行和云南本土文化，四层空间可以慢慢逛。有咖啡（约35-45元/杯）和安静的自习角落。位于翠湖北路，步行到翠湖公园只需几分钟。约21:00-22:00关门，逛完公园后直接步行过来非常方便。",
            "optional": false,
