            "notes_base": "Located on the same street as Zhibushi Bookstore, Mocui Whisky Lounge offers a quiet, intimate end to the evening. Small space, carefully curated whisky selection, non-clubbing atmosphere. Perfect for INFJs — no loud music, just good drinks and conversation. Budget around 70-90 CNY per person for one to two drinks. Opens from around 20:00.",
            "notes_local": "与纸布石书店在同一条街，逛完书店后步行即到。墨翠是翠湖边一家安静小巧的威士忌酒吧，精选威士忌，非夜场风格，不吵闹。非常适合INFJ类型，安静地喝一两杯结束一天。人均70-90元。约20:00开始营业。",
