            "notes_base": "Arrival day in Lijiang — no need for intense plans. After checking in, take a leisurely stroll through the Old Town (古城). Start at Four Square Street (四方街) and explore the surrounding lanes. Evening is much quieter than daytime, and the stone-paved streets with lantern glow are deeply romantic. Free entry to most areas. Walk as long as energy allows — rest day tomorrow.",
            "notes_local": "到达丽江第一天，适合轻松感受古城。入住后从四方街出发，沿新义街、五一街漫步。夜晚人少，石灯小桥流水，气氛温馨浪漫。古城本身免费，随心散步，明天还有好好休息的机会。",
