            "notes_base": "Upon arriving in Dali in the evening, take a stroll through the Old Town. The area around Foreigner Street (洋人街), Renmin Road (人民路), and Huguo Road (护国路) is the heart of Dali's evening scene — full of independent cafes, bars, and shops. The Old Town is walkable and the vibe is relaxed and authentic. Free to walk around.",
