            "notes_base": "After the Erhai Lake cycling and Shuanglang beach day, end the afternoon at Shanxian Coffee in Shuanglang. Positioned right at the lakeside with clear views of the water and mountains. Sunset here is spectacular — the lake turns golden. Order a Yunnan specialty coffee or the local cloud tea (云雾茶). Arrive by 17:30 to get good seats for the sunset. Around 45-55 CNY per person.",
            "notes_local": "洱海环湖和双廊沙滩游玩后，在双廊山茧咖啡结束这一天。咖啡馆紧贴洱海，日落时分湖面金光万道。点一杯云南手冲或云雾茶，坐在湖边静静发呆。建议17:30前到，占好临湖位置。人均45-55元。",
